  "caveats": [
    "A Mandarin consonant inventory depends on the declared phonological analysis; orthographic initials are not automatically 21 independent phonemes.",
    "IPA candidates are conventional broad teaching transcriptions, not measured speech tokens.",
    "The r initial varies between approximant and fricative realizations. The placeholder ɻ is a codebook choice, not a certified exclusive realization.",
    "Velar fricative h may be transcribed [x] or [h] under different phonetic conventions or phonological contexts.",
    "The zero initial and y/w spelling tokens are not assigned unconditional consonant IPA values.",
    "Finals, vowel allophones, rhotic suffixes, and tone sandhi are outside this initial-only comparison.",
    "No symbols, articulation assertions, or educational effectiveness findings receive independent approval here."
